  m_Name: Inspector Morwood
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Inspector Morwood
  offerText: Your thermal pipes are critically over-pressurized. Pay my emergency
    plumbing fee immediately, or your room will be completely destroyed tonight.
  acceptResultText: You pay the steep fee. Morwood works on the pipes, and hearing
    the steam flow smoothly again gives you great peace of mind.
  rejectResultText: You laugh at his obvious scare tactics and kick him out. Keeping
    your money safe from scammers makes you feel incredibly smart.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: Morwood wasn't lying! The pipes violently explode while you
    sleep! You are badly burned by the steam, and your room is ruined by the debris.
